# COSMObase BP-TZVPD-FINE pure-solvent panel for medicinal/process chemistry screening.
# One solvent per line. Comment lines start with '#'. Blank lines ignored.
# Names match COSMObase filenames (without _c0.cosmo suffix).
#
# Dropped (not in BP-TZVPD-FINE database): dichloromethane, mtbe,
#   n-methylpyrrolidone, 1,2-propanediol.

# --- Protic polar (9) ---
h2o
methanol
ethanol
propanol
2-propanol
1-butanol
1-octanol
glycol
glycerol

# --- Aprotic polar (6) ---
dimethylsulfoxide
dimethylformamide
n,n-dimethylacetamide
propanone
acetonitrile
butanone

# --- Ether / Ester / Cyclic (6) ---
thf
dioxane
ethylacetate
isopropylacetate
diethylether
anisole

# --- Nonpolar (5) ---
hexane
n-heptane
cyclohexane
toluene
1,4-dimethylbenzene

# --- Halogenated (2) ---
chloroform
1,2-dichloroethane
